        "score": "BOS 2, NSH 0",
        "text": "Casey Mittelstadt scored at 3:49 off a David Pastrnak assist, and Elias Lindholm made it 2–0 on the power play at 16:38, set up by Charlie McAvoy. Predators captain Roman Josi said Boston \"had the puck the whole period.\""
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 4, NSH 0",
        "text": "Pastrnak tipped a McAvoy shot at 9:46 for a 3–0 lead. At 17:21, JJ Peterka redirected Pastrnak's centering pass off the left post and poked in his own rebound for 4–0."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 6, NSH 0",
        "text": "Mark Kastelic scored on a backhand at 6:50, and Pastrnak added a wrist shot from the top of the slot at 15:00. Michael DiPietro finished the shutout on Hockey Fights Cancer Night."
      }
